d69ee54a89e4a41e5b90bc3e28d8f075e53e4b","published_at":"2026-11-19T18:54:19Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这是一项系统化梳理研究，用类似自动驾驶级别的自主性框架评估大模型在真实软件漏洞发现、验证和修补中的能力，并按正确性、可用性与证据强度对相关主张分级。研究还分析十年来的公开漏洞记录、公告与利用数据，并评估文献中提出的缓解措施。","title":"SoK: Assessing the Evolution of LLM Capability in Software Vulnerability Research"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_747b17aaa33d4426f21f853c732e7f85bb518fe5f58b8aea92faac6286d8fd2e","internal_url":"/posts/20261119-blogs_podcasts-ainews-gemini-4-neon-gdms-opussol-contender-0-d095f837df/","observation_id":"obs_d095f837dfa59f6ca3be18e7e5a388a05edd149eebee0533bba3df7ab6cc3a81","published_at":"2026-11-19T07:07:43Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"当前保存的是 RSS 或来源节选，不代表原文全文。请以原始来源为准。","title":"[AINews] Gemini 4 Neon: GDM's Opus/Sol Contender"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_77766f45c9266a4dcc8f24d34866268194cdf083dbc3d6ae1cef3ce8507925d3","internal_url":"/posts/20261119-blogs_podcasts-how-airbnb-uses-cost-per-task-to-operate-coding-ag-0-02a9f081f7/","observation_id":"obs_02a9f081f7220770d133b5928d994e7885fa25ce0b6eff6c1d405f4bdfe338d0","published_at":"2026-11-18T21:48:19Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"Airbnb 介绍了如何用真实工程任务评测编码代理模型，并通过 Amazon Bedrock 和 Amazon CloudWatch 持续监控生产表现。核心依据是每项任务成本，同时关注延迟、限流和 token 消耗。","title":"How Airbnb uses cost per task to operate coding agents on Amazon Bedrock"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_c494d2f950725add78e5ac9d0efcf0bf1fc10ec6af034b14b90c908013ec93bb","internal_url":"/posts/20261120-arxiv-knowing-what-you-know-a-trait-theory-of-reviewer-v-0-9414947fea/","observation_id":"obs_9414947fea04778a1da2a02a7792e341671207fa6e9840f40c066c3ff9a02268","published_at":"2026-11-18T18:55:07Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这篇论文提出“评审者价值”理论：人机共同决策时，人类能否持续创造价值，关键在于其信心与判断正确率是否匹配，即元认知校准。论文结合 AI 辅助会计系统六个月的生产数据，对该理论及其边界进行分析。","title":"Knowing What You Know: A Trait Theory of Reviewer Value in Human-AI Cognitive Systems"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_1b92b6a5b5a4e3a75354136cb1383cf4a613d6896b05d2ff1d58043148f1ca63","internal_url":"/posts/20261119-arxiv-rsibench-infra-can-agents-optimize-their-own-train-0-8c79a09d70/","observation_id":"obs_8c79a09d70d62ee0814db31ff9e3de6e1393ced1da7b00a3a2357c1f6648181c","published_at":"2026-11-18T13:29:44Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"RSIBench-Infra 是面向生产级训练与推理优化的基准，包含20项任务，允许代理跨引擎、内核和指令层修改软件栈。评测在任务质量约束下衡量端到端性能，并使用 OCI 镜像层协议记录改动以便复现部署。","title":"RSIBench-Infra: Can Agents Optimize Their Own Training and Inference Infrastructure at Production Scale?"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_ff1bb866f4c19670002813834decb1d3e8ca638fe697b7f20df7768680052bc7","internal_url":"/posts/20261118-blogs_podcasts-managed-nvidia-dynamo-on-amazon-sagemaker-hyperpod-0-4df567e648/","observation_id":"obs_4df567e64846f78674c5776162311be11b2f8e2bf8e52723529eaf159029fb79","published_at":"2026-11-17T23:33:26Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"当前保存的是 RSS 或来源节选，不代表原文全文。请以原始来源为准。","title":"Managed NVIDIA Dynamo on Amazon SageMaker HyperPod Inference"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_a34ab54f5ecae222e1836853e0a1863a9d9dd10307b133f33781403a03bf0ab4","internal_url":"/posts/20261118-blogs_podcasts-cut-generative-ai-costs-code-for-rules-models-for--0-ecd295cd80/","observation_id":"obs_ecd295cd80fbdb5f0bdd3a6049720c3cb955c7794916b348e1fbc196d4c17c77","published_at":"2026-11-17T21:14:55Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一篇关于降低生成式 AI 系统成本的实践文章，主张先判断每个工作流步骤是否真的需要调用模型：能用确定性规则完成的任务交给代码，只有开放、含糊或需要生成的任务才交给模型。文章还介绍了固定选项决策、结构化输出与分层升级等实现方式，并结合 Amazon Bedrock 和 AWS 工作流服务说明落地路径。","title":"Cut generative AI costs: Code for rules, models for judgment"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_f70f9da2118a09ce9d7179504633cf8a394933cd3bd3dfd45e862eed8cf07eff"